     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I don't see a good argument for keeping this as a user-modifiable triple. The only argument I can see for keeping it as a server-managed triple would be to facilitate propagating authz information from the repository to the index.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
